// microbench hop1_label: the Posts (not Comments) a person created (T3, type filter on a
// heterogeneous 1-hop).
// Reads: the hasCreator _to edge index from the anchor; the type test reads the collection off
// each message's _id (no message property is read).
// Evaluator: queries/hop.py hop1_label -- read_neighbors + dedup + read_filter_by_label_probe
// (free for arango: the type is in the id), count-final (the harness counts the returned keys).
// mb2 lineage: MB39-40, 139-140, 239-240 (no arango text in mb2).
FOR m IN 1..1 INBOUND CONCAT("Person/", @personId) hasCreator
    OPTIONS {order: "bfs", uniqueVertices: "global"}
    FILTER IS_SAME_COLLECTION("Post", m._id)
    RETURN m._key
